  "batch": "df39f087-5ad6-4fc4-acfa-8c3dc9941ee1",
  "caveats": "Each ZIP download contains the original scanned TIFF files for a single calendar\nyear, including monthly and dekadal scans. The files are provided in a ZIP archive\nto preserve the original sources and may be extracted and converted as needed.\n\n\nValues saturate in very dense tropical forests (though less so than NDVI). In arid\nregions with very sparse vegetation, the signal may be dominated by soil background\nreflectance. This is raw vegetation status data, not an anomaly, so interpretation\nof \"drought\" requires knowledge of the typical phenological cycle for the region.",
  "creator_user_id": "1a008a13-52b1-4326-a9ea-aa541372577c",
